{{SVGRef}}{{SeeCompatTable}}

The **`method`** attribute indicates the method by which text should be rendered along the path of a [textPath](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/textPath) element.

You can use this attribute with the following SVG elements:

- [textPath](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/textPath)
</Value>
