    <Members>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>AppliesTo</Name>
        <Value>marker marker marker</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Description</Name>
        <Value>

{{SVGRef}}

The **`markerHeight`** attribute represents the height of the viewport into which the [marker](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/marker) is to be fitted when it is rendered according to the {{SVGAttr("viewBox")}} and {{SVGAttr("preserveAspectRatio")}} attributes.

You can use this attribute with the following SVG elements:

- [marker](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/marker)
</Value>
