  </Type>
  <Type>
    <Name>SVG.Attribute.opacity</Name>
    <Members>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>AppliesTo</Name>
        <Value>a audio canvas circle ellipse foreignObject g iframe image line marker path polygon polyline rect svg switch symbol text textPath tspan use unknown video</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Category</Name>
        <Value>Presentationattributes</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Description</Name>
        <Value>

{{SVGRef}}

The **`opacity`** attribute specifies the transparency of an object or of a group of objects, that is, the degree to which the background behind the element is overlaid.

&gt; **Note:** As a presentation attribute, `opacity` can be used as a CSS property. See the {{cssxref("opacity", "CSS opacity")}} property for more information.

You can use this attribute with the following SVG elements:

- [a](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/a)
- [audio](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/audio)
- [canvas](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/canvas)
- [circle](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/circle)
- [ellipse](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/ellipse)
- [foreignObject](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/foreignObject)
- [g](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/g)
- [iframe](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/iframe)
- [image](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/image)
- [line](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/line)
- [marker](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/marker)
- [path](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/path)
- [polygon](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/polygon)
- [polyline](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/polyline)
- [rect](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/rect)
- [svg](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/svg)
- [switch](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/switch)
- [symbol](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/symbol)
- [text](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/text)
- [textPath](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/textPath)
- [tspan](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/tspan)
- [use](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/use)
- [unknown](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/unknown)
- [video](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/video)
</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Example</Name>
        <Value>```css hidden
html,
body,
svg {
  height: 100%;
}
```
```html
&lt;svg viewBox="0 0 200 100" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"&gt;
  &lt;defs&gt;
    &lt;linearGradient id="gradient" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="0" y2="100%"&gt;
      &lt;stop offset="0%" style="stop-color:skyblue;" /&gt;
      &lt;stop offset="100%" style="stop-color:seagreen;" /&gt;
    &lt;/linearGradient&gt;
  &lt;/defs&gt;
  &lt;rect x="0" y="0" width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#gradient)" /&gt;
  &lt;circle cx="50" cy="50" r="40" fill="black" /&gt;
  &lt;circle cx="150" cy="50" r="40" fill="black" opacity="0.3" /&gt;
&lt;/svg&gt;
```</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Group</Name>
        <Value>global_attributes</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Header</Name>
        <Value>System.Collections.Hashtable</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>IsDeprecated</Name>
        <Value>False</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Name</Name>
        <Value>opacity</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
