  <Type>
    <Name>SVG.Attribute.v-ideographic</Name>
    <Members>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>AppliesTo</Name>
        <Value>font-face</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Description</Name>
        <Value>

{{SVGRef}}

The **`v-ideographic`** attribute indicates the alignment coordinate for {{Glossary("glyphs")}} to achieve ideographic {{Glossary("baseline/typography", "baseline")}} alignment for vertically oriented glyph layouts. The value is an offset in the font coordinate system relative to the glyph-specific {{SVGAttr("vert-origin-x")}} attribute.

You can use this attribute with the following SVG elements:

- [font-face](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/font-face)
</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Group</Name>
        <Value>elements</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Header</Name>
        <Value>System.Collections.Hashtable</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>IsDeprecated</Name>
        <Value>True</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Name</Name>
        <Value>v-ideographic</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>PSTypeName</Name>
        <Value>SVG.Attribute</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
    </Members>
  </Type>
  <Type>
    <Name>SVG.Attribute.begin</Name>
    <Members>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>AppliesTo</Name>
        <Value>animate animateMotion animateTransform set animate animateMotion animateTransform set</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Category</Name>
        <Value>Animationtimingattributes</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Description</Name>
        <Value>

{{SVGRef}}

The **`begin`** attribute defines when an animation should begin.

The attribute value is a semicolon separated list of values. The interpretation of a list of start times is detailed in the SMIL specification in ["Evaluation of begin and end time lists"](https://www.w3.org/TR/2001/REC-smil-animation-20010904/#Timing-EvaluationOfBeginEndTimeLists). Each individual value can be one of the following: `&lt;offset-value&gt;`, `&lt;syncbase-value&gt;`, `&lt;event-value&gt;`, `&lt;repeat-value&gt;`, `&lt;accessKey-value&gt;`, `&lt;wallclock-sync-value&gt;` or the keyword `indefinite`.

You can use this attribute with the following SVG elements:

- [animate](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/animate)
- [animateMotion](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/animateMotion)
- [animateTransform](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/animateTransform)
- [set](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/set)
</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Header</Name>
        <Value>System.Collections.Hashtable</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>IsDeprecated</Name>
        <Value>False</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Name</Name>
        <Value>begin</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>PSTypeName</Name>
        <Value>SVG.Attribute</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
    </Members>
  </Type>
  <Type>
    <Name>SVG.Attribute.specularExponent</Name>
    <Members>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>AppliesTo</Name>
        <Value>feSpecularLighting feSpotLight feSpecularLighting feSpotLight</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Description</Name>
        <Value>

{{SVGRef}}

The **`specularExponent`** attribute controls the focus for the light source. The bigger the value the brighter the light.

You can use this attribute with the following SVG elements:

- [feSpecularLighting](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/feSpecularLighting)
- [feSpotLight](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/feSpotLight)
</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Example</Name>
        <Value>```css hidden
html,
body,
svg {
  height: 100%;
}
```
```html
&lt;svg viewBox="0 0 420 200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"&gt;
  &lt;filter id="diffuseLighting1" x="0" y="0" width="100%" height="100%"&gt;
    &lt;feSpecularLighting in="SourceGraphic" specularExponent="1"&gt;
      &lt;fePointLight x="60" y="60" z="20" /&gt;
    &lt;/feSpecularLighting&gt;
  &lt;/filter&gt;
  &lt;filter id="diffuseLighting2" x="0" y="0" width="100%" height="100%"&gt;
    &lt;feSpecularLighting in="SourceGraphic" specularExponent="5"&gt;
      &lt;fePointLight x="60" y="60" z="20" /&gt;
    &lt;/feSpecularLighting&gt;
  &lt;/filter&gt;

  &lt;rect
    x="0"
    y="0"
    width="200"
    height="200"
    style="filter: url(#diffuseLighting1);" /&gt;
  &lt;rect
    x="0"
    y="0"
    width="200"
    height="200"
    style="filter: url(#diffuseLighting2); transform: translateX(220px);" /&gt;
&lt;/svg&gt;
```</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Header</Name>
        <Value>System.Collections.Hashtable</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>IsDeprecated</Name>
        <Value>False</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Name</Name>
        <Value>specularExponent</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>PSTypeName</Name>
        <Value>SVG.Attribute</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
    </Members>
