    <Members>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>AppliesTo</Name>
        <Value>feBlend feBlend</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Description</Name>
        <Value>

{{SVGRef}}

The **`mode`** attribute defines the blending mode on the [feBlend](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/feBlend) filter primitive.

You can use this attribute with the following SVG elements:

- [feBlend](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/feBlend)
</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Example</Name>
        <Value>```css hidden
html,
body,
svg {
  height: 100%;
}
```
```html
&lt;svg viewBox="0 0 480 200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"&gt;
  &lt;filter id="blending1" x="0" y="0" width="100%" height="100%"&gt;
    &lt;feFlood
      result="floodFill"
      x="0"
      y="0"
      width="100%"
      height="100%"
      flood-color="seagreen"
      flood-opacity="1" /&gt;
    &lt;feBlend in="SourceGraphic" in2="floodFill" mode="multiply" /&gt;
  &lt;/filter&gt;
  &lt;filter id="blending2" x="0" y="0" width="100%" height="100%"&gt;
    &lt;feFlood
      result="floodFill"
      x="0"
      y="0"
      width="100%"
      height="100%"
      flood-color="seagreen"
      flood-opacity="1" /&gt;
    &lt;feBlend in="SourceGraphic" in2="floodFill" mode="color-dodge" /&gt;
  &lt;/filter&gt;

  &lt;image
    href="mdn_logo_only_color.png"
    width="200"
    height="200"
    style="filter:url(#blending1);" /&gt;
  &lt;image
    href="mdn_logo_only_color.png"
    width="200"
    height="200"
    style="filter:url(#blending2); transform:translateX(220px);" /&gt;
&lt;/svg&gt;
```</Value>
