  <Type>
    <Name>SVG.Attribute.refX</Name>
    <Members>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>AppliesTo</Name>
        <Value>marker symbol marker symbol symbol use marker</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Description</Name>
        <Value>

{{SVGRef}}

The **`refX`** attribute defines the x coordinate of an element's reference point.

You can use this attribute with the following SVG elements:

- [marker](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/marker)
- [symbol](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/symbol)
</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Header</Name>
