      </NoteProperty>
    </Members>
  </Type>
  <Type>
    <Name>SVG.Attribute.scale</Name>
    <Members>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>AppliesTo</Name>
        <Value>feDisplacementMap filter feDisplacementMap</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Description</Name>
        <Value>

{{SVGRef}}

The **`scale`** attribute defines the displacement scale factor to be used on a [feDisplacementMap](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/feDisplacementMap) filter primitive. The amount is expressed in the coordinate system established by the {{SVGAttr("primitiveUnits")}} attribute on the [filter](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/filter) element.

You can use this attribute with the following SVG elements:

- [feDisplacementMap](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/feDisplacementMap)
</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Example</Name>
        <Value>```css hidden
html,
body,
svg {
  height: 100%;
}
```
```html
&lt;svg viewBox="0 0 480 220" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"&gt;
  &lt;filter id="displacementFilter" x="-20%" y="-20%" width="140%" height="140%"&gt;
    &lt;feTurbulence
      type="turbulence"
      baseFrequency="0.05"
      numOctaves="2"
      result="turbulence" /&gt;
    &lt;feDisplacementMap in2="turbulence" in="SourceGraphic" scale="5" /&gt;
  &lt;/filter&gt;
  &lt;filter id="displacementFilter2" x="-20%" y="-20%" width="140%" height="140%"&gt;
    &lt;feTurbulence
      type="turbulence"
      baseFrequency="0.05"
      numOctaves="2"
      result="turbulence" /&gt;
    &lt;feDisplacementMap in2="turbulence" in="SourceGraphic" scale="50" /&gt;
  &lt;/filter&gt;

  &lt;circle cx="100" cy="100" r="80" style="filter: url(#displacementFilter);""/&gt;
  &lt;circle cx="100" cy="100" r="80" style="filter: url(#displacementFilter2);
  transform: translateX(240px);""/&gt;
&lt;/svg&gt;
```</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Group</Name>
        <Value>elements</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Header</Name>
        <Value>System.Collections.Hashtable</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>IsDeprecated</Name>
        <Value>False</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Name</Name>
        <Value>scale</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>PSTypeName</Name>
        <Value>SVG.Attribute</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
    </Members>
