        <Value>x1</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>PSTypeName</Name>
        <Value>SVG.Attribute</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
    </Members>
  </Type>
  <Type>
    <Name>SVG.Attribute.r</Name>
    <Members>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>AppliesTo</Name>
        <Value>circle radialGradient circle</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Description</Name>
        <Value>

{{SVGRef}}

The **`r`** attribute defines the radius of a circle.

You can use this attribute with the following SVG elements:

- [circle](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/circle)
- [radialGradient](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/radialGradient)

When the value is set as a percentage, it refers to the normalized diagonal of the current SVG viewport.
</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Example</Name>
        <Value>```css hidden
html,
body,
svg {
  height: 100%;
}
```
```html
&lt;svg viewBox="0 0 300 200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"&gt;
  &lt;radialGradient r="0" id="myGradient000"&gt;
    &lt;stop offset="0" stop-color="white" /&gt;
    &lt;stop offset="100%" stop-color="black" /&gt;
  &lt;/radialGradient&gt;
  &lt;radialGradient r="50%" id="myGradient050"&gt;
    &lt;stop offset="0" stop-color="white" /&gt;
    &lt;stop offset="100%" stop-color="black" /&gt;
  &lt;/radialGradient&gt;
  &lt;radialGradient r="100%" id="myGradient100"&gt;
    &lt;stop offset="0" stop-color="white" /&gt;
    &lt;stop offset="100%" stop-color="black" /&gt;
  &lt;/radialGradient&gt;

  &lt;circle cx="50" cy="50" r="0" /&gt;
  &lt;circle cx="150" cy="50" r="25" /&gt;
  &lt;circle cx="250" cy="50" r="50" /&gt;

  &lt;rect x="20" y="120" width="60" height="60" fill="url(#myGradient000)" /&gt;
  &lt;rect x="120" y="120" width="60" height="60" fill="url(#myGradient050)" /&gt;
  &lt;rect x="220" y="120" width="60" height="60" fill="url(#myGradient100)" /&gt;
&lt;/svg&gt;
```</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Header</Name>
        <Value>System.Collections.Hashtable</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>IsDeprecated</Name>
        <Value>False</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Name</Name>
        <Value>r</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
