    <Name>SVG.Attribute.y</Name>
    <Members>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>AppliesTo</Name>
        <Value>feBlend feColorMatrix feComponentTransfer feComposite feConvolveMatrix feDiffuseLighting feDisplacementMap feDropShadow feFlood feFuncA feFuncB feFuncG feFuncR feGaussianBlur feImage feMerge feMergeNode feMorphology feOffset fePointLight filter feSpecularLighting feSpotLight filter feTile feTurbulence filter foreignObject glyphRef glyphRef image mask pattern rect svg text tref tref tspan use rect</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Description</Name>
        <Value>

{{SVGRef}}

The **`y`** attribute defines a y-axis coordinate in the user coordinate system.
</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Header</Name>
        <Value>System.Collections.Hashtable</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
