    </Members>
  </Type>
  <Type>
    <Name>SVG.Attribute.text-decoration</Name>
    <Members>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>AppliesTo</Name>
        <Value>text textPath tref tspan</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Category</Name>
        <Value>Presentationattributes</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Description</Name>
        <Value>

{{SVGRef}}

The **`text-decoration`** attribute defines whether text is decorated with an underline, overline and/or strike-through. It is a shorthand for the {{cssxref("text-decoration-line")}} and {{cssxref("text-decoration-style")}} properties.

The fill and stroke of the text decoration are given by the fill and stroke of the text at the point where the text decoration is declared.

The paint order of the text decoration, i.e. the fill and stroke, is determined by the value of the {{SVGAttr("paint-order")}} attribute at the point where the text decoration is declared.

&gt; **Note:** As a presentation attribute, `text-decoration` can be used as a CSS property. See the {{cssxref("text-decoration", "CSS text-decoration")}} property for more information.

You can use this attribute with the following SVG elements:

- [text](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/text)
- [textPath](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/textPath)
- [tref](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/tref)
- [tspan](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/tspan)
</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Example</Name>
        <Value>```css hidden
html,
body,
svg {
  height: 100%;
}
```
```html
&lt;svg viewBox="0 0 250 50" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"&gt;
  &lt;text y="20" text-decoration="underline"&gt;Underlined text&lt;/text&gt;
  &lt;text x="0" y="40" text-decoration="line-through"&gt;Struck-through text&lt;/text&gt;
&lt;/svg&gt;
```</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Group</Name>
        <Value>global_attributes</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Header</Name>
        <Value>System.Collections.Hashtable</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>IsDeprecated</Name>
        <Value>False</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Name</Name>
        <Value>text-decoration</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>PSTypeName</Name>
        <Value>SVG.Attribute</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
    </Members>
  </Type>
  <Type>
    <Name>SVG.Attribute.systemLanguage</Name>
    <Members>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>AppliesTo</Name>
        <Value>a animate animateMotion animateTransform audio canvas circle clipPath cursor defs ellipse foreignObject g iframe image line mask path pattern polygon polyline rect set svg switch text textPath tref tspan unknown use video switch</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Category</Name>
        <Value>Conditionalprocessingattributes</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Description</Name>
        <Value>

{{SVGRef}}

The **`systemLanguage`** attribute represents a list of supported language tags. This list is matched against the language defined in the user preferences.

You can use this attribute with the following SVG elements:

- [a](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/a)
- [animate](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/animate)
- [animateMotion](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/animateMotion)
- [animateTransform](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/animateTransform)
- [audio](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/audio)
- [canvas](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/canvas)
- [circle](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/circle)
- [clipPath](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/clipPath)
- [cursor](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/cursor)
- [defs](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/defs)
- [ellipse](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/ellipse)
- [foreignObject](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/foreignObject)
- [g](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/g)
- [iframe](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/iframe)
- [image](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/image)
- [line](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/line)
- [mask](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/mask)
- [path](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/path)
- [pattern](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/pattern)
- [polygon](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/polygon)
- [polyline](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/polyline)
- [rect](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/rect)
- [set](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/set)
- [svg](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/svg)
- [switch](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/switch)
- [text](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/text)
- [textPath](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/textPath)
- [tref](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/tref)
- [tspan](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/tspan)
- [unknown](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/unknown)
- [use](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/use)
- [video](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/web/svg/element/video)
</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Group</Name>
        <Value>global_attributes</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Header</Name>
        <Value>System.Collections.Hashtable</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>IsDeprecated</Name>
        <Value>False</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Name</Name>
        <Value>systemLanguage</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>PSTypeName</Name>
        <Value>SVG.Attribute</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
    </Members>
  </Type>
  <Type>
    <Name>SVG.Attribute.xml:lang</Name>
    <Members>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>AppliesTo</Name>
        <Value>
        </Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Category</Name>
        <Value>Coreattributes</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
      <NoteProperty>
        <Name>Description</Name>
        <Value>

{{SVGRef}}

The **`xml:lang`** attribute specifies the primary language used in contents and attributes containing text content of particular elements.

It is a universal attribute allowed in all XML dialects to mark up the natural human language that an element contains.

There is also a {{SVGAttr("lang")}} attribute (without namespace). If both of them are defined, the one with namespace is used and the one without is ignored.
</Value>
      </NoteProperty>
